Today's hashtag is right here!

154
00:13:30,366 --> 00:13:38,916
えーハッシュタグ、えー「#雪花ラミィ生誕3DLIVE2026」
The hashtag is... um, "#YukihanaLamyBirthday3DLIVE2026"!

