Something is going to happen right here during the next song!

189
00:15:49,974 --> 00:15:51,324
ということでね、
So with that said,

190
00:15:51,474 --> 00:15:56,874
みんな、いろんなところに注目して、今日は最後まで楽しんでってください！
look all over the stage, everyone, and have fun right until the end today!

191
00:15:57,224 --> 00:16:00,924
